        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Keep the oven at a low 160C and cover the tin tightly with foil for most of the cook. A high temperature will tighten the meat rather than melt the collagen into the sauce." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
